# on a top level while -g reaches generics only.  afe_stub_top.vhd adds the
# width (MW = 3, MCU.vhd:827) and nothing else, so the counts frozen here are
# afe_stub's own.  OWNER_HART = 1 is afe0 (MCU.vhd:3111); the four sites
# differ only in that constant.
